# Databases
*.db

# Logs — bridge.log is PLAINTEXT MESSAGE HISTORY, and this repo has a public remote.
# The trailing * is load-bearing: logrotate writes `bridge.log-20260803-113854.gz`, which
# `*.log` does NOT match. Found 2026-08-03 the moment rotation was first enabled — a 12 MB
# gzip of personal chats sat untracked-but-committable until this line existed.
*.log*

